msgstr "Membutuhkan operator saluran (@) atau pemilik (~) status"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:19
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:19
